[gd_scene format=3]

; The Chapterhouse, through the Undercroft's high doorway (map offset (292.5, 6)): the choir's chapter house, its
; back half drowned, a tall vault on a single pier standing in the water, the choir's stalls at either end. The
; Precentor (boss placeholder) beats time in the middle of the bare floor. Stepping into the hall drops the two
; portcullises in the vestibules behind and ahead (BossSeal); breaking the Precentor raises them for good. West: back onto the Undercroft's ledge (the way up needs Mag-grip or Harpoon, on the Undercroft's side).
; East: on to the Brink.

